{"id":"wb-6-148","name":"望城岗冶铁遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"望城岗冶铁遗址","text":"望城岗冶铁遗址，位于河南省鲁山县城南与张店乡望城岗村北之间。遗址自西汉至东汉时期，历时300余年。\n1963年6月，河南省人民委员会以望城冈冶铁遗址之名列入第一批河南省文物保护单位。2006年5月，中国国务院以望城岗冶铁遗址之名列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9C%9B%E5%9F%8E%E5%B2%97%E5%86%B6%E9%93%81%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":93684512,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93684512","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ee028e438fb7cd177ad8ab43.png","title":"望城岗冶铁遗址地图.svg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%9C%9B%E5%9F%8E%E5%B2%97%E5%86%B6%E9%93%81%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.svg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/%E6%9C%9B%E5%9F%8E%E5%B2%97%E5%86%B6%E9%93%81%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%9C%B0%E5%9B%BE.svg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Walter Grassroot","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​望城岗冶铁遗址地图","width":320,"height":381}}